@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
}

<div class="page">
    <h1>About <span>VitaBloom</span></h1>

    <p>
        VitaBloom is a simple health and wellness platform designed to help
        users build healthy habits and take better care of themselves.
        It provides useful and easy-to-use features that encourage people
        to stay active, eat healthy, drink enough water, and maintain a
        balanced lifestyle.
    </p>

    <p>
        Through VitaBloom, users can explore healthy recipes, track their
        water intake, monitor their daily activities, and connect with a
        supportive community. Our goal is to make health and wellness
        simple, enjoyable, and accessible for everyone.
    </p>

    <h2>Our Goal</h2>

    <p>
        Our goal is to encourage people to make healthier choices every day
        by providing simple tools and helpful information. VitaBloom aims
        to inspire users to develop positive habits, become more active,
        and take small steps toward a healthier and happier lifestyle.
    </p>

    <p>
        We believe that staying healthy does not have to be difficult.
        With consistent effort, proper nutrition, regular movement, and
        good daily habits, everyone can work toward becoming a healthier
        version of themselves.
    </p>

    </div>

